The first oracle solved `easy`, so that rung will not ship. This is useful calibration rather than a gate failure: the harness is escalating automatically, and I’ll retain its untuned ladder result exactly as produced.
diff --git a/gen_1303_0729.py b/gen_1303_0729.py
